WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:29.070
Gamus Ragu, a Buff Clan samurai...

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:35.120
sent out all of his remaining forces
to attack the Ideon and Solo Ship.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:44.910
Unable to move due to its unstable
 energy, the Solo Ship was in danger.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:52.130
However, the ship raised a giant barrier and
 eventually managed to repel Gamus' attack.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:06.060
Despite the victory over Gamus, the
 Solo Ship suffered heavy damage.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:11.270
The Solo Ship departed from
 the planet of water, Flag Star.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:17.940
<b>Sink the Enemy Battleship</b>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.910
We're entering DS Drive in fifteen minutes!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.540
All personnel, return to the ship!

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.580
Okay! It's all good!

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.630
Has the Ideon Gauge changed at all?

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.090
It doesn't seem any different on the surface.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.370
But unless we break the Ideonite that
 covers the gauge, we can't know for sure.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:42.290
You're right.

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.930
When was the last time you washed your socks?

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.090
Four days ago, probably.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:49.230
Can't you ask Lotta to do it?

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:50.310
Entering DS Drive!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.210
Hatari, are you ready?

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:51.930
Go ahead!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.940
Joliver! The Ideon Gauge seems to be working fine!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.160
Coordinates confirmed!

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.810
Target, Planet Buff Clan!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:09.930
The homeworld!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.830
Wait, wait!

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:12.040
The coordinates are unstable!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.130
We can correct them!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.710
Fire up the main engine!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.850
The Giant of Ide...

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.580
It has to be true, or I'm in trouble.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:36.730
Otherwise I'll become nothing but
 a laughing stock for my failures!

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:37.690
Lady Harulu!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:38.690
What is it?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.360
We've entered DS Drive!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.890
However, it'll take some time
to fine tune the coordinates...

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:46.370
Hurry up. I want to return as fast as possible.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.420
It looks like the gauge on the
 Ideon has powered up too.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.000
Investigate the connection with Hatari!

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:21.670
Lou, what are you doing here?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.690
Jeez!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.750
Lin! Lotta!

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.610
Didn't I tell you not to let Piper Lou in here?!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.430
Yes.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:29.860
The gauge is powering up!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.540
It's almost as vivid as a living being...

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.040
I wonder why?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:43.150
The Solo Ship is damaged, and there 
aren't any enemies nearby either...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.280
What was that?!

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.190
Bes!

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.600
Can you see anything on the right?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:57.750
The right?

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.940
Starboard surveillance monitors,
don't let it out of our sight!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:00.900
All hands!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.780
An enemy ship is approaching
on our starboard stern side!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.160
Bes?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.370
There's nothing there!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.460
Is the main engine operational?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:17.870
Enemy ship on our left!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.230
Stabilize our coordinates!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.760
Do you mean the Dorowa Zan's
 coordinates aren't set properly?

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:22.670
Why?

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.460
I don't know!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.880
I didn't order you to chase the alien ship!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.710
Open all gun turrets on the starboard side!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.530
All Ideon units, prepare to launch!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.980
Lady Harulu, I figured out what's causing this.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:41.900
The enemy ship pulled us in, causing the
 Dorowa Zan to convene with them!

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:42.610
What?

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.780
It's a dimensional resonance!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.010
Can't we get away from them?

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:46.980
Y-Yes!

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:49.580
We'll try our best to keep our distance!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.180
A power that warps both space and time...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.330
Does the alien ship from Logo Dau have that?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.290
Why is this?!

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.810
Are we never going to get away from the Buff Clan?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:06.760
At least the light on the
Ideon Gauge is increasing...

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.180
Sorry for keeping you.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.050
Sorry for the trouble.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.060
Check the enemy's fighting strength.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:15.810
Roger!

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:16.560
Bes!

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:21.520
In this situation, aren't we free to
 decide whether to fight or run away?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:25.720
Yes, the barrier should have sufficient power.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:26.690
Hatari!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:27.360
Yes!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.410
The barrier isn't only for subspace flight, we can do it!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.040
Let's fight them!

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:32.950
Sheryl!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.370
I agree with her!

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.620
I think we should fight.

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:38.750
Normally...

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.870
The Dorowa Zan always attacks first,

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.490
but this time they're waiting for us to make a move.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.260
What do you mean?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.220
If they're not attacking, they probably
 don't have much fighting strength.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.970
Sol-Amber, standby for docking!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.300
Sol-Conver, ready to dock!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.180
Sol-Vanier, starting to dock!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:59.310
Heavy Mobile Mecha Giran Dou, launch!

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.250
Cut the barrier!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:28.380
Launch the Ideon!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.070
Turn the Solo Ship around!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.390
The enemy ship is coming our way!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.090
Concentrate your fire right at them!

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:46.630
Yes ma'am!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.900
What do you think?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.610
The enemy ship is approaching, but we
 have next to no weapons to fight it with!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.060
I believe we should get away from it, if possible.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.790
There should be at least one Zigg Mack undergoing
 repairs! Make sure it's ready to launch!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:00.250
Yes!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.600
It's better that we avoid the enemy
 ship, but it pays to be prepared!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:05.540
Yes!

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.670
We'll withdraw after planting the tracking device!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.300
But, what about the Giran
Dou we launched before?

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:16.570
Srimula and Haun shall receive a posthumous 
 two-rank promotion for their efforts.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.930
Right now, our top priority is
to bring the data back home!

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.870
It looks like the enemy ship is trying to escape, Cosmo!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.040
Roger!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.460
The barrier is constantly getting stronger!

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:51.090
Okay!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.130
Contact the Ideon!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.600
We need to sink that ship
while we're in DS Fight!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.090
Karala, is this all right?

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.980
Do it, there's no other way.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.410
My stubborn sister...

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.460
Maybe this is better than living the
 rest of her life obsessed with power.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.440
Don't spare a single missile!
 Keep firing until you run out!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.240
The enemy's faltering.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.530
We can win!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:21.830
We're going to win this!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.880
Moera! This isn't the time to laugh!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.290
The power is rising!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.360
Use the Glenn Cannons effectively!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.280
If the Ideon's power has gone up,
 we don't even need missiles!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:42.600
Glenn Cannons, fire!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.050
Yeah!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.580
Techno! What happened?

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.310
The Glenn Cannon overloaded!

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:51.940
What?!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:06.510
Never mind the damaged parts!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.040
Concentrate on attacking!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.880
There will be no more fighting tomorrow, it ends today!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.880
All capable hands, fire the guns!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.050
This seems different from usual!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.630
Everyone's so fired up...

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.010
Do you understand it?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.090
It's strange.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:25.100
Everyone's will to fight is high, but it doesn't seem
 to be the reason the Ideon Gauge is powering up...

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.710
Now that you mention it, the light
 of the gauge looks unstable...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:34.650
Cosmo!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.650
The Ideon is acting strangely!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.310
Why is it shaking like this?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:39.530
Moera!

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.760
I don't get it!

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:45.030
The normal engine started overheating as well!

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:48.200
It's not working, I can't control
 the main engine's power output!

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.650
What is this? What was that roar?!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.250
What happened?

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.340
The Ideon has docked out!

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:01.890
What'd you say?!

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:02.800
Now of all times?!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:03.800
In the middle of the fight?

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.760
The Ideon?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.260
What's behind this?

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:09.910
The parts are rejecting each other
 due to the abnormal rise of power!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.940
What happened?

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:16.180
Ideon!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:17.530
Why won't you move?!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.110
Deck!

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.490
Keep firing the missiles!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:25.830
Moera!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.830
How's the power control?!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.290
Watch me, I can still fight with one unit!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.170
We're in the middle of subspace flight!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.320
You'll be in danger with the Sol Conver's power alone!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.280
The power itself is still rising!

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.040
I'll be okay!

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.660
The Giant has broken apart?

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:46.380
Yes! We don't know what sort
 of attack they're planning!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.640
Please put on a spacesuit!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.310
Send the Zigg Mack out!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:50.770
No!

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.670
We can still get away from them!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.060
Please, put on a spacesuit!

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:54.670
All right.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.000
Don't spare the missiles!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.250
Fire, fire! Fire them all!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:20.610
Lady Harulu!

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:21.920
We have an incoming message.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.770
Never mind! There's an
 enemy right in front of us!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.970
But, it's for Lady Harulu...

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.010
Amplify it!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:28.950
Dorowa Zan!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.270
You must be Lady Harulu Ajiba.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.480
It's dangerous if you stay here!

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.630
Get out of subspace and flee!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.440
Can you hear me?

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.270
Dorowa Zan!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.110
Lady Harulu Ajiba!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.690
That voice...

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.360
Do I recognize that voice?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.360
Answer us!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.070
Dorowa Zan!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.040
Lady Harulu!

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.520
Ask them for an escape point!

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:49.870
Yes ma'am!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.740
This is the Dorowa Zan!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.160
Tell us the point to escape to!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.250
This is the Dorowa Zan!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:55.920
R 12...

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.790
K 23...

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.550
We've caught a Buff Clan transmission!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:02.090
Karala!

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:02.800
Huh?

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:04.010
Yes!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.220
I'll repeat the recording.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:08.510
Please translate it.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.440
They seem to be canceling
subspace navigation...

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.860
The distance is 2.67 later sects.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.530
Coordinates are R, K... 12, 23!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.810
All hands! We're going to use the DS Brake!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:29.530
Get ready!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:30.070
Karala!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.990
Karala, thank you.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:32.870
All Ideon units!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.750
Retreat!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.200
Projecting the entire space map!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:14.330
Position confirmed!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.210
Garadonia, Area 24!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.790
The person who sent us the
message must be near here!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.210
Hurry and find them!

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:24.690
What's this?!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.130
I don't know!

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.010
Something is emitting a powerful magnetic wave!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.480
What?!

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.380
What's going on?

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.260
All personnel!

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.800
Look at your panels!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.490
Some sort of anomaly happened near the Dorowa Zan!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.960
Why are they here?!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.920
We're right below the enemy ship!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:02.920
Cosmo!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:03.750
Bes!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.460
We need to escape!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.880
Normal engine, maximum power!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:07.420
Wait!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.300
We can't leave from here!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:10.460
We'd only get shot at!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.390
But we can't fire our missiles from here!

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.510
We'll wait for the enemy ship to leave!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.970
All personnel, prepare for hand to hand combat!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.140
Lotta!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:19.680
Lin!

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.770
You got that, right?

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:23.190
Get the civilians as deep as possible into the ship!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.810
Get spacesuits and weapons!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:25.860
Yes!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.280
Lotta!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.150
Are we really gonna fight?

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.320
With things like this, we can't run away.

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.120
Don't fire at the enemy ship!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.200
We'll get caught up in it too!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.540
What should we do, Zekitan?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.620
Hand to hand combat is our only choice!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.830
Okay, everyone get ready
to board the enemy ship!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:49.340
Use the front missiles to prevent
 the Giant parts from launching!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.270
Cosmo!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.100
What should we do?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:04.980
What about the Ideon?

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.010
We're going to launch!

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:09.120
We can't afford to let any enemies
 board the Ideon like before.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.990
Pull down the lever under the gauge.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.280
Okay, the power is becoming stable!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.290
Can we dock?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.210
We can dock!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.040
The normal engine is powered up!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:25.670
Roger!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:28.500
They're moving out!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.690
Go away, get out of here!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:55.660
Lin, hurry!

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.570
We can't let them get past this point!

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:00.280
I wonder if I can fire a gun?

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:01.040
Shoot!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.370
Over there!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.090
Lotta, what's wrong?

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.380
I killed him! I killed someone!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.030
Didn't I order you to keep the Giant down?!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:33.680
I'll sink this ship before the Solo Ship is boarded!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:34.950
Cosmo! The bridge!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.360
Aim for the bridge!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.030
Roger!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.160
Please respond.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.250
This is the Dorowa Zan, please respond!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.750
That familiar voice...

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:50.290
If it was Daram Zuba,

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.170
is he going to just wait and
 watch me get killed?

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:08.190
Bes!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.020
Damn you!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:14.980
Hey, the Dorowa Zan!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.820
Return to the Dorowa Zan!

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.240
We need protect our ship first!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:19.450
Hatari!

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.750
Get away from the enemy ship!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.620
We're going to get engulfed in the explosion!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:23.280
Roger!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.580
Sister...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.040
From this day forward, we don't
 have to hate each other anymore...

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.670
The end is always easy...

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.510
Lady Harulu, get ready to escape!

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.750
You're playing with me until the very end...

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.520
Do you want me to surrender to the aliens?

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:51.400
Finish it off!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.110
All missiles, fire!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:02.700
We did it!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.120
We defeated the aliens!

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.690
Cosmo, the bridge!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.370
I won't let you run away!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:16.960
What the?

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.780
They got away...

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.420
What a fast machine...

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.460
A new type of Heavy Mobile Mecha...

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.670
Check the damages and
casualties on the Solo Ship!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.930
It seems that I have to thank you.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.770
You saved us, I'm grateful.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:59.060
We were late in sending help because
we had to assess the enemy's strength.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:00.470
I'm sorry about that.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:04.400
I don't want to hear your insincere apologies!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:10.830
This ship and the Heavy Mobile
Mecha don't belong to the military.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.700
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.580
You haven't changed at all, Lady Harulu Ajiba.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.440
People don't change that easily!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.260
And certainly not for your sake!

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.800
For your journey back home,
 you can borrow that ship.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.050
That'll be adequate!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.430
I have one condition.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.230
I had to stick my neck out to get that ship.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.310
When you get back to the
homeland, return it right away.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:40.090
I wouldn't want to be in your debt.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.670
Gije Zaral?

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:10.090
Are we all just being manipulated by the
 Solo Ship's mysterious power of Ide?

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.760
What do you think, Sheryl?

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:14.160
That might be so.

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:18.420
As long as we don't understand the Ide's
control system, that could be a possibility.

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:22.230
There's no doubt that the power
has gone up, more than ever.

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:31.280
What is causing the Ide gauge to
glow more than it ever has before?

00:22:32.070 --> 00:22:36.090
And whom does this power serve?

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>Two groups alien to each other are brought
 together by the legendary infinite power, Ide.</i>

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:57.350
<i>The Legendary Giant Ideon stands up.</i>

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:04.900
<i>Were the fates of Cosmo, Bes and Karala
 entrusted to the Ide during that moment?</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:09.150
<i>Watch as the Solo Ship and
 Ideon set off on their journey.</i>

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:14.330
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant 
Ideon: "The Legend Lives Again"</i>

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:17.660
<b>The Legend Lives Again</b>

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:17.660
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.650
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

